    "The coordination polymers form through self-assembly during in situ generation of 1,2,4-triazole under solvothermal conditions.",
    "Direct use of Htrz is ineffective: complexes 1-5 cannot be made by simply adding metal salts to Htrz under the same solvothermal conditions.",
